ore_btn:"Restore from profile",device_edit_btn:"Review and edit",dk_mgr_title:"This device isn't verified yet as the group organizer's device",dk_mgr_body:"{pass, select, yes {That's why expense details are hidden here and organizer actions aren't available. They're open from the device that created the group, or here — after signing in with the organizer password.} other {That's why expense details are hidden here and organizer actions aren't available. They're open from the device that created the group.}}",dk_mgr_login_btn:"Sign in with organizer password",dk_mgr_nopass:"To manage from here too, set an organizer password in the group settings on the device that created the group, then sign in with it here. No access to that device? The service operator can set a temporary password for the group.",dk_mgr_recover_link:"How to recover organizer access",dk_ask_wa:"Hi, could you please reset the “linked device” for {name}'s account in the group “{group}” on {brand}? (Group settings → the participant → Reset linked device). Thanks!",dk_lost_title:"Your join went through, but the confirmation didn't reach this device",dk_elsewhere_title:"Your account is linked to another device",dk_lost_body:"The connection dropped while you were joining: your account was created in the group, but its personal key wasn't saved here. To update your payment details and edit your expenses from here, the group organizer needs to reset the linked device. After the reset, this device will reconnect on its own.",dk_elsewhere_body:"To update your payment details and edit your expenses from here, the group organizer needs to reset the linked device. After the reset, this device will reconnect on its own.",dk_ask_btn:"Ask {name} on WhatsApp",restored_toast:"Payment details restored from the profile on this device ✓",save_fail_toast:"Saving failed — please try again",toast_mine_elsewhere:"Your payment details were changed from another device — was it you?",toast_phone_mine:"Your phone number in the group has changed — worth checking",toast_phone_other:"{name}'s phone number has changed — confirm it before transferring",toast_pay_mine:"Your payment details in the group were updated — please check they're correct",toast_pay_other:"{name}'s payment details were updated — confirm them before transferring",prefs_denied_toast:"Payment details can be updated only by the participant or the group organizer",sheet_title_self:"How would you like to get paid?",sheet_title_other:"How would {name} like to get paid?",sheet_lead_self:"When someone in the group needs to pay you, this is what they'll see, with copy buttons. Optional, and you can change it any time.",sheet_lead_other:"When someone in the group needs to pay {name}, this is what they'll see, with copy buttons. Optional, and you can change it any time.",sheet_proxy_note:"Entering for {name}: group members will see the change as “updated by {by}”. Make sure to confirm the details with {name}.",manager_fallback:"the group organizer",save_btn:"Save",saving_btn:"Saving…",clear_btn:"Remove payment details from the group",forget_btn:"Delete the details saved on this device",no_change_toast:"No change to the payment details",removed_toast:"Payment details removed from the group",saved_toast:"Payment details saved ✓",saved_notify_toast:"Payment details saved ✓ — group members will see they were updated",clear_confirm_title:"Remove payment details",clear_confirm_body:"Your ways to get paid will be removed from the group, and group members will see a notice about the change. Continue?",clear_confirm_btn:"Remove",forgot_toast:"Details deleted from this device ✓",join_phone_hint:"Leave empty to use the phone number you entered above. You can enter a different number.",join_toggle:"How would you like to get paid?",join_toggle_optional:"(optional)",join_toggle_sel:"Selected: {methods} — saved when you join",join_loading_eyebrow:"One moment…",join_loading_title:"Loading the group details",join_noshare_eyebrow:"Almost there",joi